  m_Name: Basic Knife
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Rusty Spreader
  descriptionEnglish: This is a dull and rusted blade, barely fit for combat. It
    looks like it's seen better days and probably should be used only as a last resort.
    Its only other purpose seems to be spreading butter on bread, if you can find
    any. You wonder how you'll survive with this pathetic excuse for a weapon.
  nameChinese: "\u751F\u9508\u7684\u5C0F\u5200"
  descriptionChinese: "\u8FD9\u662F\u4E00\u628A\u975E\u5E38\u5F31\u7684\u5C0F\u5200\uFF0C\u51E0\u4E4E\u6CA1\u6CD5\u7528\u6765\u6218\u6597\u3002\u5B83\u7684\u950B\u5229\u7A0B\u5EA6\u4E0D\u53CA\u4E00\u6839\u6728\u52FA\uFF0C\u552F\u4E00\u7684\u7528\u9014\u5C31\u662F\u6D82\u62B9\u9762\u5305\u4E0A\u7684\u9EC4\u6CB9\u3002\u5EFA\u8BAE\u4F5C\u4E3A\u6700\u7EC8\u624B\u6BB5\u4F7F"
  namePortuguese: Espalhadora Enferrujada
  descriptionPortuguese: "Esta \xE9 uma faca muito fraca e deve ser usada como \xFAltimo
    recurso. \xC9 t\xE3o afiada quanto uma colher de pau e sua \xFAnica utilidade
    seria passar manteiga no p\xE3o."
  nameSpanish: Esparcidor Oxidado
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "Esta es una hoja aburrida y oxidada, apenas apta para
    el combate. Parece que ha visto mejores d\xEDas y probablemente deber\xEDa usarse
    solo como \xFAltimo recurso. Su \xFAnico otro prop\xF3sito parece ser untar mantequilla
    en el pan, si puedes encontrar alguna. Te preguntas c\xF3mo sobrevivir\xE1s con
    esta pat\xE9tica excusa de arma."
